<p><span lang=3DEN-CA style=3D'mso-ansi-language:EN-CA'>Dear <b>Chase</b>=
 account
holder,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p><span lang=3DEN-CA style=3D'mso-ansi-language:EN-CA'>We recently revie=
wed your
account, and suspect that your <strong>Chase Internet Banking </strong><s=
pan
class=3DGramE>account</span> may have been accessed by an unauthorized th=
ird
party. Protecting the security of your account and of the <strong>Chase B=
ank </strong>network
