temporarily limited access to sensitive account features. <o:p></o:p></sp=
an></p>

<p><span lang=3DEN-CA style=3D'mso-ansi-language:EN-CA'>To restore your a=
ccount
access, please take the following steps to ensure that your account has n=
ot
been compromised:<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p><span lang=3DEN-CA style=3D'mso-ansi-language:EN-CA'>1. Login to your =
<strong>Chase
Internet Banking </strong>account. In case you are not enrolled for Inter=
net
Banking, you will have to use your Social Security Number as both your Pe=
rsonal
ID and Password.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p><span lang=3DEN-CA style=3D'mso-ansi-language:EN-CA'>2. Review your re=
cent
